        ],
        "text": "The Court previously disapproved random vehicle stops in Delaware v. Prouse, finding them ineffective and without deterrent effect."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "de105645df7a296c5f38b16ea82f0b0436d409d5157040d7fef6e8e5b9e30bcc",
