            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 41,
              "start": 41
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice asked whether suspicionless searches of trucks for bombs, anthrax, weapons, or drugs all stand or fall together."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "de105645df7a296c5f38b16ea82f0b0436d409d5157040d7fef6e8e5b9e30bcc",
